  "body": "Sitting high and proud are eight brand-new homes, all built to a very high standard. These three-level standalone homes feature open-plan living areas with plenty of natural light, creating a real sense of space and warmth.\r\n\r\nThe homes are being built by a well-established construction company specialising in high-quality commercial and residential developments, in collaboration with two highly respected architectural firms.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nLot 8 - standalone home\r\n3 bedrooms, including a master bedroom\r\n3 bathrooms\r\nOpen-plan living and dining\r\nNorth-facing deck\r\n1 car park\r\nPlenty of on-street parking\r\n\r\nLocated on a quiet, family-friendly street, the property is just a short walk from Torbay shops, cafés and bus stops.\r\n\r\nZoned for excellent local schools:\r\n\r\nTorbay School - approximately 800m\r\nLong Bay Primary School - approximately 2km\r\nNorthcross Intermediate - approximately 2.5km\r\nLong Bay College - approximately 2.3km\r\nNearby bus routes provide convenient access to local schools\r\n\r\nApproximately a 10-minute walk to Long Bay Beach and Torbay shops, or around a 5-minute drive to Long Bay New World.\r\n\r\nViewings: Saturday and Sunday afternoons at 2 pm to 3 pm.",
